Package: portal-osint
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-flask
Recommends: chromium-browser | chromium, whois, dnsutils, nmap
Maintainer: Abuu20 <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Abuu20/portal
Description: PORTAL - local OSINT / recon lookup dashboard
 One search box for IPs, domains, emails, URLs, files, CVEs, usernames
 and phone numbers, with a link-analysis graph, a CTF workbench
 (decoders, flag finder, RSA/Vigenere/XOR crackers), offline Office
 and binary triage, and an optional local toolbox of active scanners.
 Runs entirely on 127.0.0.1; nothing leaves this machine unless you
 explicitly run an active tool against a target you choose.
